<title>USA: CSR files shelf for $400 million debt.</title>
<headline>CSR files shelf for $400 million debt.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>CSR Limited filed Friday with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission a shelf registration for up to $400 million in debt securities.</p>
<p>The Sydney, Australia-based firm said net proceeds will be used for general corporate purposes including working capital, capital expenditure and other corporate purposes, including the repayment of indebtedness.</p>
